::  name       layout column ceiling gate
::  shape      col - int (@u32) -> lawful - int (@u32)
::  invariant  answers 1 while the column stays at or under 39; answers 0 past
::  the grid
::  law        brushstroke/skate_cell_grid.rye grid_cols=40 (0-indexed)
::  example    0 -> 1 - 39 -> 1 - 40 -> 0
::  readers    Brushstroke - Skate - Glow layout
::  nib        glow-language journey Orbit 10 -- layout shapes (20261104)
::
::  Skate's cell grid is 40 columns wide. A column index is valid from
::  0 through 39. This gate refuses anything past the last column.
|=  sample=@u32
?:  (gth sample 39)  0  1
